<title>NORWAY: Bergesen 9-month results fall.</title>
<headline>Bergesen 9-month results fall.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>				  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating revenue	    3,375    vs	3,186</p>
<p> Operating costs		2,420    vs	2,362</p>
<p> Depreciations		    647    vs	  571</p>
<p> Operating result		 308    vs	  253</p>
<p> Net interest expenses	  218    vs	  171</p>
<p> Pre-tax result		    97    vs	  366</p>
<p> After-tax result		  81    vs	  282</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian shipping group is Bergesen d.y. ASA. Analysts polled by Reuters had expected a pre-tax profit of 208 million crowns for the first nine months.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
